      "pin": "video:203251"
    },
    {
      "text": "So why does your mind keep doing this?",
      "query": "rain on window night",
      "visual": "video",
      "pin": "video:238465"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because to your brain, a conversation is never just small talk. It's a quiet test of whether you still belong.",
      "query": "conversation cafe",
      "visual": "photo",
      "motion": "pan_right",
      "fallback_queries": [
        "people talking table",
        "friends coffee talking"
      ],
      "exclude": [
        "photo:4707539",
        "photo:2574276"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So it rewinds the moment again and again, searching for the part you might have gotten wrong.",
      "query": "lonely man city night",
      "visual": "photo",
      "motion": "zoom_out",
      "fallback_queries": [
        "man alone night",
        "lonely man"
      ],
      "pin": "photo:4191143"
    },
    {
      "text": "Psychologists call this post-event processing. And here's what most people never realize.",
      "query": "woman window thinking",
      "visual": "photo",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "fallback_queries": [
        "woman looking out window",
        "pensive woman"
      ],
      "exclude": [
        "video:22761"
      ],
      "pin": "photo:7106217"
    },
    {
      "text": "The other person probably isn't replaying it at all.",
      "query": "people walking busy street",
      "visual": "video",
      "pin": "video:248449"
    },
    {
      "text": "Research on the spotlight effect shows we consistently overestimate how much others notice our mistakes.",
      "query": "person spotlight dark",
      "visual": "photo",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "fallback_queries": [
        "spotlight stage",
        "stage light"
      ],
      "exclude": [
        "photo:950382"
      ],
      "avoid": [
        "green",
        "lamp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So tonight, when the replay starts, ask yourself one question.",
      "query": "night sky stars",
      "visual": "video",
      "pin": "video:209264"
    },
    {
      "text": "Would I judge a friend this harshly for the same moment?",
